        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>了解自己 - 男士体型穿搭指南</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #e9e9e9;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #f0efec;\n    border: 6px solid #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    padding: 12px 10px 16px 10px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    background: #0d2a4d;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .header .badge {\n    background: #f5e6c8;\n    color: #0d2a4d;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 5px 10px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n  .header .man {\n    text-align: right;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .header .man .title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .header .man .sub {\n    font-size: 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: #cfd8e3;\n  }\n\n  .labels-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .label-box {\n    flex: 1;\n    margin: 0 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #333;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 4px 2px;\n  }\n  .label-box.c1 { background: #cfe0ea; }\n  .label-box.c2 { background: #cfe3d0; }\n  .label-box.c3 { background: #e9d9c2; }\n  .label-box.c4 { background: #d9d9d9; }\n  .label-box.c5 { background: #d3d3d3; }\n\n  .figures-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .figure-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 95px;\n    height: 220px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #dfe6ee, #dfe6ee 6px, #eef2f6 6px, #eef2f6 12px);\n    border: 1px dashed #7d93ab;\n    color: #0d2a4d;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .text-block {\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .tb1 { background: #d7e6ef; }\n  .tb2 { background: #d9ecd9; }\n  .tb3 { background: #f0e0c2; }\n  .tb4 { background: #eecdd4; }\n  .tb5 { background: #dcdcdc; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">了解自己</div>\n    <div class=\"man\">\n      <div class=\"title\">MAN</div>\n      <div class=\"sub\">小型穿搭日记</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"labels-row\">\n    <div class=\"label-box c1\">长条形</div>\n    <div class=\"label-box c2\">三角形</div>\n    <div class=\"label-box c3\">倒三角</div>\n    <div class=\"label-box c4\">长方形</div>\n    <div class=\"label-box c5\">梭圆形</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"figures-row\">\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Figure: 长条形人体轮廓，深蓝色剪影，胸腹部有青色矩形描边]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Figure: 三角形人体轮廓，深蓝色剪影，肩窄臀宽，青色三角形描边]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Figure: 倒三角人体轮廓，深蓝色剪影，肩宽臀窄，青色倒三角描边]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Figure: 长方形人体轮廓，深蓝色剪影，肩臀同宽，青色矩形描边]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"figure-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Figure: 梭圆形人体轮廓，深蓝色剪影，腰腹圆润，青色椭圆描边]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block tb1\">\n    特征为竹竿, 四肢细小, 建议选择有口袋的工装风, 机能风能增加视觉的厚度。学会叠穿,\n    穿出层次感, 也能弱化瘦小的视觉效果避免紧身裤, 太紧身无疑是暴露竹竿型的视觉。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block tb2\">\n    特征为肩膀窄, 腹部有赘肉, 选择挺阔面料的衣服, 也能增加肩膀轮廓感<br>\n    通过上半身的配饰点缀: 如项链 帽子 叠穿等, 打造V领视觉\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block tb3\">\n    特征为上半身显壮, 肩部较宽, 腿部发达, 上半身可以选择胸围较宽的宽松版型衣服,\n    下半身可以选择直筒版型平衡视觉\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block tb4\">\n    特征为腰部肩部和臀部基本同宽, 常见于不健身或者宅男人群, 上半身可以选择落肩版\n    型直挺材质衣服, 同时缩小腰部视觉, 下半身可以选择直筒型的裤子\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block tb5\">\n    特征为圆润饱满, 体型偏胖。上半身可以选择宽松直挺型的上衣, 下半身选择宽松直筒\n    型的裤子, 修饰腿型, 不宜太宽松。\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
